'''Training Area''' (Japanese: '''トレーニングエリア''' ''Training Area'') is a {{TCGP|Stadium card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Stadium
|rule=SV Stadium
|effect=Attacks used by Stage 1 Pokémon in play ''(both yours and your opponent's)'' do +10 damage to the opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

==Trivia==
*This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Practice Studio}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
